        "expression": "let grad = mix(c2, c1, smoothstep(-0.5, 0.5, p.y));\nlet wash = mix(grad, c3, 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(p.x * 2.0 + t * 0.1));\nvar band = mix(bg, wash, 0.85);\nvar ink = 0.0;\nfor (var i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n    let k = f32(i);\n    let phase = t * (0.25 + 0.05 * k);\n    let env = 0.6 + 0.4 * sin(p.x * 2.0 + k * 1.3 + phase * 0.5);\n    let wave = wave_amp * env * sin(p.x * (4.0 + k * 1.5) + phase + k * 2.1);\n    let yw = -0.42 + k * 0.17 + wave;\n    let above = smoothstep(0.0, 0.01, p.y - yw);\n    let lane = mix(c4, c5, k / 5.0);\n    band = mix(band, mix(band, lane, 0.55), above);\n    let d = abs(p.y - yw);\n    ink = max(ink, 1.0 - smoothstep(line_width, line_width + 0.0015, d));\n}\nlet ink_col = mix(bg * 0.55, vec3<f32>(0.0), blackness);\nlet color = mix(band, ink_col, ink);\nreturn mix(bg, color, strength);",
